  "title": "Under Armour Welcomes Tinx as New Brand Ambassador",
  "summary": "Under Armour today welcomes Tinx, as its newest brand ambassador, representing both UA footwear and apparel. A creator, entrepreneur, bestselling author, and one of the most influential voices shaping modern conversations around confidence, wellness, and self-worth, Tinx joins the UA family as the brand continues to broaden its definition of performance.",
